<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{.ServiceName}}</title>
</head>
<body>
<p><strong>{{.ServiceName}}</strong></p>
<p>Someone asked to reset the password of the account that uses this address.</p>
{{if .Link}}<p>To choose a new password, open <a href="{{.Link}}">this link</a>. It works for {{.LinkExpiresIn}}.</p>
<p>If the link does not open, copy this address into the browser:<br>{{.Link}}</p>
{{end}}{{if .Code}}<p>{{if .Link}}Or enter this code{{else}}To choose a new password, enter this code{{end}}. It works for {{.CodeExpiresIn}}:</p>
<p style="font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 4px;"><strong>{{.Code}}</strong></p>
{{end}}<p>If this was not you, ignore this message. Your password will not change.</p>
</body>
</html>
